      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c2aa6a2ad47dd72d5f0e7c30f5f7225d85514344.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/c2aa6a2ad47dd72d5f0e7c30f5f7225d85514344\" title=\"Screenshot_20220310-064212\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c2aa6a2ad47dd72d5f0e7c30f5f7225d85514344_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220310-064212\" data-base62-sha1=\"rM5JWPOZkoPExUNoPIN8IDv66Gw\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c2aa6a2ad47dd72d5f0e7c30f5f7225d85514344_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c2aa6a2ad47dd72d5f0e7c30f5f7225d85514344_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c2aa6a2ad47dd72d5f0e7c30f5f7225d85514344_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c2aa6a2ad47dd72d5f0e7c30f5f7225d85514344_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220310-064212</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 104 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Yeah, this was a super easy one.  She didn’t bring ANY crew other than Trueshot, who isn’t worth bothering to try and kill, so there was nothing to distract the heroes from cleaning her clock.</p>",
